+	/*
+	 * After the boot-time data-path death the SMLH/RDLH status bits
+	 * stay latched "up" even though the LTSSM itself dropped back to
+	 * DETECT_QUIET and outbound TLPs never reach the endpoint.  In
+	 * that state only a full vendor bring-up gives us a chance, so
+	 * pretend the link is down and run the cold path regardless.
+	 */
